# Next.js / UI

- Put routes under `app/`; colocate `loading.tsx` skeletons for slow data pages.
- Stream heavy details inside `<Suspense>` with a keyed fallback; keep nav/footer outside.
- Fonts: Geist/Jakarta variables on `<html>` only (`app/layout.tsx`).
- Override `SectionShell` padding with `innerClassName` + `!` utilities when matching Figma.
- Images: `next/image` + `FallbackImage` for remote API/S3 URLs; `CoinPlaceholder` on error/empty.
- After replacing a same-path asset, clear `.next/cache/images`.
- Browse state via search params (`page`, `category`, `from`, `show`).
- Theme colors/radii/fonts live in `app/globals.css` `@theme` — use those tokens.
